File: contrib/addtiffo/tif_overview.c
Line: 520
Function: TIFF_DownSample_Subsampled
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: pabySrcTile is allocated in TIFFBuildOverviews at lines 905-909 without NULL-check and is then passed to TIFF_ProcessFullResBlock and further to TIFF_DownSample_Subsampled. If allocation failed, dereferencing *(pabySrcTile + ...) at line 520 will crash.

